      "designator": "CS25-0",
      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart D \u2014 Design And Construction",
      "title_at_revision": "Protection of structure",
      "text": "Each part of the structure must (see AMC 25.609)- (a) Be suitably protected against deterioration or loss of strength in service due to any cause, including \u2013 (1) Weathering; (2) Corrosion; and (3) Abrasion; and (b) Have provisions for ventilation and drainage where necessary for protection.",
